              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हळवा — haḷvā — \"tender-hearted\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "माझी बहीण खूप हळवी आहे, लगेच रडते. mājhī bahīṇ khūp haḷvī āhe, lagec raḍte. My sister is very tender-hearted; she cries at once."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Agrees: हळवा (haḷvā), हळवी, हळवं. हळवं मन, a sensitive heart."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हळवा (haḷvā) is usually traced to Sanskrit laghu, \"light, quick\": CDIAL lists Marathi haḷū, \"light\", and haḷvā, \"ripening quickly\", under it (CDIAL 10896). The sense \"tender-hearted\" is not given there, so the link is not certain."
            }
          ]
        },
